---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | TheEduAssist"
  description="Learn about the mission, values, and core team behind TheEduAssist and how we are empowering publishers with modern headless architectures."
>
  {/* Hero / About Banner */}
  <section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-transparent relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Our Story
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 tracking-tight max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6 leading-tight">
        Empowering clear technical communication worldwide
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        We bridge the gap between heavy software engineering and elegant visual content management.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(#e2e8f0_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:16px_16px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_50%_50%_at_50%_50%,#000_60%,transparent_100%)] opacity-60"></div>
  </section>

  {/* Mission & Vision Section */}
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose-custom">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>TheEduAssist</strong>, our mission is simple: to make knowledge sharing fast, reliable, and accessible. In a digital world dominated by slow-loading templates and fragile content models, we design robust content systems using static site generators like <strong>Astro</strong> and headless CMS environments like <strong>PagesCMS</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          We believe that authors shouldn't have to understand Git branch semantics to publish a blog post, nor should developers have to debug custom databases just to add an FAQ section or update search metadata. By decoupling the content from the delivery layer, we enable teams to produce exceptionally optimized websites that achieve outstanding Core Web Vitals on day one.
        </p>

        <blockquote class="my-8">
          "The best website is the one that loads instantly, responds smoothly on mobile, and speaks clearly to both human readers and search crawlers."
        </blockquote>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4">Core Principles</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Performance First:</strong> Zero javascript by default. Deliver optimized static HTML to the browser instantly.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Friction:</strong> Simple, intuitive CMS form layouts that match your code schemas 1:1.</li>
          <li><strong>Full Accessibility:</strong> Semantic markup, proper heading sequences, and compliance with modern standards.</li>
          <li><strong>Complete SEO Control:</strong> Expose schema flags, robots overrides (noindex), and hreflangs directly to creators.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Timeline/History Stats */}
  <section class="py-16 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">How we grew</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mt-2">A quick snapshot of our milestones over the last few years.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 shadow-soft">
          <div class="text-brand-600 font-black text-3xl mb-2">2023</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Platform Inception</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            TheEduAssist was founded as a private training portal to help SaaS teams master SEO and headless deployments.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 shadow-soft">
          <div class="text-brand-600 font-black text-3xl mb-2">2024</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Decoupled Stack Launch</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            We introduced full integration with PagesCMS and automated Schema metadata, processing over 100,000 monthly publications.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 shadow-soft">
          <div class="text-brand-600 font-black text-3xl mb-2">2025</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Global Education Support</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Expanded to multi-language hreflang structures, with deep sitemap indexing and hybrid SSR models supporting modern teams.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Contact Placeholder / Form */}
  <section id="contact" class="py-24 bg-white scroll-mt-10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-[32px] p-8 sm:p-12 border border-slate-100">
        <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 tracking-tight">Get in touch</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mt-2">Have questions about setting up Astro or PagesCMS? We'd love to help you build your stack.</p>
        </div>

        <form class="space-y-6" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Message sent successfully!');">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div>
              <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Full Name</label>
              <input
                type="text"
                id="name"
                name="name"
                required
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 text-sm shadow-sm"
                placeholder="Sarah Miller"
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Email Address</label>
              <input
                type="email"
                id="email"
                name="email"
                required
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 text-sm shadow-sm"
                placeholder="sarah@example.com"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="subject" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Subject</label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="subject"
              name="subject"
              required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 text-sm shadow-sm"
              placeholder="How can we help?"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Message</label>
            <textarea
              id="message"
              name="message"
              rows="5"
              required
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 text-sm shadow-sm"
              placeholder="Your question or feedback..."
            ></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white transition duration-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/10 hover:shadow-brand-500/20"
            >
              Send Message
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
